The '''Esports World Cup''' is a tournament series that was announced in late 2023, building off the previously established [[Gamers8]] series. '''Rocket League''' was announced as part of the line-up on March 13, 2024.<ref name="EWC RL">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ESWCgg/status/1767943708824174824|title=It's time to conquer the pitch ⚽️🚗|date=2024-03-13|author=Esports World Cup|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} English}}</ref>
:''See [[esports:Esports_World_Cup/2024|here]] to read about the Esports World Cup 2024, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

