==About==
The '''Esports World Cup''' is a tournament series that was announced in late 2023, building off the previously established [[Gamers8]] series. '''Rocket League''' was announced to be returning as part of the 2025 line-up on December 15, 2024.<ref name="EWC RL">{{cite web|url=https://www.rocketleague.com/en/news/rlcs-2025-updates|title=RLCS 2025: Updates:|date=2024-12-15|author=Psyonix|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} English}}</ref><ref name="RL">{{cite web|url=https://www.x.com/ewc_en/status/1868340246724690075|title=Refuel and return to the pitch|date=2024-12-15|author=EWC|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} English}}</ref>
:''See [[esports:Esports_World_Cup/2025|here]] to read about the Esports World Cup 2025, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

===Format===
*'''Group Stage''' - ''August 14th - 16th, 2025''
** 16 teams divided into 4 groups where they play GSL Format.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
** <span class="bg-up">Top 2 teams</span> in each group advance to [[#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
** <span class="bg-down">Bottom 2 teams</span> in each group are eliminated.

*'''Playoffs''' - ''August 16th - 17th, 2025''
** Single Elimination Bracket
** Quarterfinals were drawn randomly with 2-0 teams facing 2-1 teams.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo7}}.

